  "post_content": "<p>Onda y casi toda la comarca Espad&aacute;n-Mijares est&aacute; inmersa este s&aacute;bado en la celebraci&oacute;n de la fiesta de San Antonio, con la bendici&oacute;n de animales y reparto de rollos, que en Onda ha sido multitudinaria. Por la noche se prenden las hogueras.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santantoniondavesprada13/santantonionda1.jpg\" alt=\"santantonionda1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santantoniondavesprada13/santantonionda10.jpg\" alt=\"santantonionda10\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santantoniondavesprada13/santantonionda11.jpg\" alt=\"santantonionda11\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santantoniondavesprada13/santantonionda12.jpg\" alt=\"santantonionda12\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santantoniondavesprada13/santantonionda13.jpg\" alt=\"santantonionda13\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santantoniondavesprada13/santantonionda14.jpg\" alt=\"santantonionda14\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santantoniondavesprada13/santantonionda15.jpg\" alt=\"santantonionda15\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santantoniondavesprada13/santantonionda16.jpg\" alt=\"santantonionda16\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santantoniondavesprada13/santantonionda2.jpg\" alt=\"santantonionda2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d